    "Name": "Freedom FREE-1A4",
    "Details": "The 1A4 is the originally produced version of the Freedom, establishing the chassis line as long range missile boats. A total of four 15-tubed LRM launchers provide adequate fire power for both direct and indirect suppressive fire. Two Medium and one ER Large Laser are available as secondary firepower, although the cooling is insufficient to handle repeated use of the energy weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - Missile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_Freedom"
  },
